          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for a whole-person conversation about your health — consultations, questions, and pragmatic integrative care.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1:#0f1724; /* deep ink */\\n      --glass-1: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\\n      --glass-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --accent-a: #8ee3c4; /* soft aqua */\\n      --accent-b: #c7a7ff; /* amethyst */\\n      --muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);\\n      --card-radius:16px;\\n      --max-width:1100px;\\n      --focus: 2px solid rgba(200,200,255,0.12);\\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background-color:var(--bg1);color:#ecf0ff;}\\n    body{\\n      background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, rgba(140,255,200,0.04), transparent 10%), radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(200,160,255,0.03), transparent 12%), url('assets/img/pattern.svg');\\n      background-size:cover,cover, 300px 300px;\\n      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;\\n      padding:48px 20px;\\n      display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;\\n    }\\n    .shell{width:100%;max-width:var(--max-width);}\\n\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-a),var(--accent-b));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#072;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(140,100,200,0.12);}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:16px;margin:0}\\n    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:#fff}\\n\\n    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:26px;align-items:start}\\n\\n    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass-1),var(--glass-2));backdrop-filter:blur(8px) saturate(120%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px) saturate(120%);border-radius:var(--card-radius);padding:22px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}\\n    .hero{padding:28px;border-radius:14px}\\n    .hero h2{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:0.2px}\\n    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .contact-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\\n    .contact-item strong{font-size:13px}\\n    .contact-item a{color:var(--accent-a);text-decoration:none}\\n\\n    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    input[type=\\\"text\\\"],input[type=\\\"email\\\"],input[type=\\\"tel\\\"],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:#fff;font-size:14px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .row .col{flex:1}\\n    .meta{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5)}\\n\\n    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-a),var(--accent-b));color:#061124;font-weight:600;border:none;cursor:pointer}\\n    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}\\n\\n    .aside{position:sticky;top:36px}\\n    .map-ux{height:220px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(140,200,180,0.06),rgba(190,150,255,0.04))}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n\\n    /* small screens */\\n    @media (max-width:900px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.aside{position:static}.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.brand h1{font-size:14px}}\\n\\n    /* focus */\\n    input:focus,textarea:focus,select:focus{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus)}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"shell\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">HM</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary navigation\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Sanctuary</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Method</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Who We Are</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section class=\\\"panel hero\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-heading\\\">\\n        <h2 id=\\\"contact-heading\\\">Reach the Sanctuary</h2>\\n        <p>Whether you have a quick question, want to book an initial conversation, or need guidance about how integrative care might complement your path, we welcome your note. We prioritize clarity, consent, and whole-person planning; no guaranteed cures—only education and collaborative support.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"contact-grid\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"contact-item\\\">\\n            <strong>Phone</strong>\\n            <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>\\n            <span class=\\\"meta\\\">Calls answered daytime; voicemail typically replied within 48 business hours.</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"contact-item\\\">\\n            <strong>Email</strong>\\n            <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n            <span class=\\\"meta\\\">For secure medical details, we will invite you to our secure intake form once you request a consult.</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"contact-item\\\">\\n            <strong>Location</strong>\\n            <span>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — telehealth + in-person options</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"contact-item\\\">\\n            <strong>Primary contact</strong>\\n            <span>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <hr style=\\\"margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\\\">\\n\\n        <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact form\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"col\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Full name\\\" required>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"col\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"Optional\\\" pattern=\\\"[+0-9\\\\-() ]{6,}\\\" >\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"reason\\\">Reason for reaching out</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"reason\\\" name=\\\"reason\\\" aria-label=\\\"Reason for contact\\\">\\n            <option value=\\\"consult\\\">New consultation</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"followup\\\">Follow up / ongoing care</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"question\\\">Question about treatments or labs</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"other\\\">Other / general</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"message\\\">Brief message</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us a little about your current concern and goals (brief).\\\" required></textarea>\\n\\n          <label style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:13px\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"consent\\\" required> I understand this is educational and supportive care; no cure is guaranteed and medical emergencies require immediate medical attention.</label>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n            <a class=\\\"btn secondary\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve a time</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"aside\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"panel map-ux\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Decorative map and contact tile\\\">\\n          <!-- decorative svg compass / waves -->\\n          <svg width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 360 220\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid meet\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n                <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8ee3c4\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"/>\\n                <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#c7a7ff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n              </linearGradient>\\n            </defs>\\n            <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\"/>\\n            <g transform=\\\"translate(24,18)\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"48\\\" r=\\\"36\\\" fill=\\\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\" stroke=\\\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\\\"/>\\n              <path d=\\\"M80 24 L110 40 L80 56 Z\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/>\\n              <text x=\\\"120\\\" y=\\\"40\\\" fill=\\\"#eafbf3\\\" font-size=\\\"14\\\" font-family=\\\"sans-serif\\\">Telehealth + In-person</text>\\n              <text x=\\\"120\\\" y=\\\"62\\\" fill=\\\"#cad9ff\\\" font-size=\\\"12\\\" font-family=\\\"sans-serif\\\">Flexible scheduling in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</text>\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:16px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"padding:14px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:15px\\\">What to expect</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">You will be invited to complete a secure intake; we review history, discuss priorities, and outline a personalized, evidence-informed plan. Labs are optional and always explained before ordering.</p>\\n          <hr style=\\\"margin:12px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\\\">\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\"><strong>Hours</strong><br>Mon–Fri 9:00–17:00 (local)</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>© <span id=\\\"year\\\">2026</span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — a whole-person practice.</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Questions? <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent-a)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n  <script>\\n    // small progressive script for the footer year\\n    (function(){var y=new Date().getFullYear();document.getElementById('year').textContent=y;})();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact page and usage notes for holistic_medicine site (layoutFamily=glass_morphism, voiceFamily=mystic_modern).\\n\\nFiles in this chunk:\\n- contact.html  -> The \\\"Connect\\\" page for direct outreach. Contains a glassmorphism UI, an accessible contact form, and an aside with logistical notes.\\n- README.md     -> This help file.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace when deploying:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n\\nNotes & integration guidance:\\n- The form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}; replace with your form handler or serverless endpoint (e.g., /api/contact or an external form provider). Keep method=\\\"post\\\".\\n- No external assets are referenced. The visuals rely on CSS + an SVG background at assets/img/pattern.svg. Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg is included in the full bundle for the decorative background.\\n- Accessibility: form controls include labels and required attributes. Consent checkbox includes an educational disclaimer (no guaranteed cures). Keep that messaging intact for regulatory clarity.\\n- Navigation labels intentionally vary across pages: this file uses \\\"Sanctuary\\\" for home and \\\"Connect\\\" for contact to keep the voice consistent but not repetitive.\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Glass morphism theme uses subtle gradients, backdrop-filter blur, and an inline decorative SVG in the aside.\\n- No external fonts or CDNs are used; system font stack is applied.\\n\\nDeveloper tips:\\n- To enable secure intake linking, change the mailto links or form action to your HIPAA-compliant intake provider if needed.\\n- The site assumes a separate assets/img/pattern.svg to create the repeating motif; that file should contain a lightweight SVG pattern (no external references) to match the mystic_modern aesthetic.\\n\\nContent guidance for holistic practice pages:\\n- Always avoid language promising cures. Focus on education, collaboration, assessments, and optional labs.\\n- Intake process: describe intake, shared plan, follow ups, and optional labs (on the approach page). Conditions page should list common concerns with disclaimers.\\n\\nIf you need a variant with alternative nav labels, adjusted color accents, or a simplified (no-js) submission example, request a follow-up and include your deployment target (static site, Netlify functions, server-backed form endpoint).\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
